# 5. Reading lesson interface

Each lesson page must include:

1. A large illustration.
2. The passage title.
3. The CEFR level and topic category.
4. A short introduction or learning objective.
5. Estimated reading time.
6. The full reading passage, divided into readable paragraphs.
